      "operation_specific": [
        "sidecar_create_denied",
        "agent_paused",
        "agent_deactivated",
        "failed_precondition"
      ],
      "description": "Idempotent ensure (CKP-0009 §4.2.1): server-derived dedupe keys are `(realm_id, controller_principal_id)` for the sidecar Circle and `(controller_principal_id, normalized_context_ref)` for the private Flow / reuse identity — `agent_principal_id` is NOT part of either key, so all eligible agents of the same controller share one sidecar per Realm. Clients MUST NOT supply Idempotency-Key. sidecar_create_denied is a deliberately generic precondition that hides whether a sidecar with the same derived short_name already exists (existence privacy)."
    },
